Z||000013||turbo86se||07-13-2001||02:13 PM||||Festiva! LOL<BR>There's a guy running around here with a red Festiva, 12" chrome plastic wheel covers, all-bass system, 5" tip coming off 1" exhaust pipe, I think I saw a type-r sticker on there somewhere. Anyways he pulled up next to me one day revving his little 2 or 3 cylinder engine that sounded like a weed-wacker. I just looked over and laughed, there was no way I was going to waste my gas ($2/gallon) on this guy, I don't even waste gas on Mustangs or Corvettes, a Festiva! LOL<P>I did read a Car and Driver where a guy put a Taurus SHO engine in his Festiva. That would move, I bet it wouldn't handle worth a darn. I think the motor was mounted behind the driver? Maybe I'm wrong. ||||reg||1
